{
  "info": {
    "name": "Walatra - Banner Iklan",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Koleksi API sesuai docs/api/banners.md. Isi variable base_url dengan URL backend yang berakhiran /api/v1, tanpa slash terakhir. Endpoint bersifat publik dan tidak memerlukan token. Pengelolaan banner dan unggah gambar dilakukan melalui panel superadmin. Tersedia request seluruh area dan filter masing-masing area banner; semua respons tetap berbentuk array data."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL backend termasuk /api/v1, tanpa slash terakhir."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Daftar banner iklan",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status respons 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"Respons berupa JSON\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.be.json;",
              "});",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Daftar banner berhasil diambil\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
              "    pm.expect(body.message).to.eql(\"Daftar banner berhasil diambil.\");",
              "    pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an(\"array\");",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"Format banner dan pengaturan tab sesuai kontrak API\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an(\"array\");",
              "    body.data.forEach(function (banner) {",
              "        pm.expect(banner.id).to.be.a(\"number\");",
              "        pm.expect(banner.name).to.be.a(\"string\");",
              "        pm.expect(banner.position).to.be.oneOf([\"main\", \"secondary_top\", \"secondary_bottom\"]);",
              "        pm.expect(banner.image_url).to.be.a(\"string\").and.match(/^https?:\\/\\//);",
              "        pm.expect(banner.cta_url).to.be.a(\"string\").and.match(/^https?:\\/\\//);",
              "        pm.expect(banner.open_in_new_tab).to.be.a(\"boolean\");",
              "        pm.expect(banner.sort_order).to.be.a(\"number\");",
              "        [\"image_preview_url\", \"starts_at\", \"ends_at\"].forEach(function (field) {",
              "            pm.expect(banner).to.have.property(field);",
              "            if (banner[field] !== null) {",
              "                pm.expect(banner[field]).to.be.a(\"string\");",
              "            }",
              "        });",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"Area sesuai filter jika position diisi\", function () {",
              "    const position = pm.request.url.query.get(\"position\");",
              "    if (position) {",
              "        body.data.forEach(function (banner) {",
              "            pm.expect(banner.position).to.eql(position);",
              "        });",
              "    }",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/banners",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "banners"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Mengambil banner aktif yang memiliki gambar dan berada dalam jadwal tayang. Tanpa token. Tambahkan query position untuk memfilter area: main, secondary_top, atau secondary_bottom. Urutan sort_order lalu banner terbaru. open_in_new_tab=false: tab yang sama; true: tab baru. Gambar PNG/JPG/WebP maksimal 2 MB, rekomendasi 1536 × 625 px; unggah melalui panel superadmin."
      },
      "response": [
